{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "t0", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 20, "width": 424, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PD-1: ¿Qué archivos transferir?", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 24, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-1: ¿Qué archivos transferir?", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t1", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 56, "width": 692, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RemoteSchooly. Tres iteraciones acumulativas: cada una conserva la anterior y agrega una capa.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "RemoteSchooly. Tres iteraciones acumulativas: cada una conserva la anterior y agrega una capa.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "l2", "type": "line", "x": 10, "y": 88, "width": 1190, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d4d4d8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [1190, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t3", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 108, "width": 122, "height": 21.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ITERACIÓN #1", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ITERACIÓN #1", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t4", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 132, "width": 219, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "El sistema como una sola caja", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El sistema como una sola caja", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t5", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 164, "width": 276, "height": 165.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. Valeria, en Lima, publica el material\n   de la semana.\n\n2. El sistema tiene que hacérselo llegar\n   a la escuela.\n\n3. Rosa enseña con ese material, haya o\n   no haya Internet en ese momento.\n\nTodavía no decimos cómo se hace. Solo\nqué entra y qué sale.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Valeria, en Lima, publica el material\n   de la semana.\n\n2. El sistema tiene que hacérselo llegar\n   a la escuela.\n\n3. Rosa enseña con ese material, haya o\n   no haya Internet en ese momento.\n\nTodavía no decimos cómo se hace. Solo\nqué entra y qué sale.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "r6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 410, "y": 175, "width": 130, "height": 70, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t7", "type": "text", "x": 410, "y": 194.375, "width": 130, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Valeria", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 14, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Valeria", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "t8", "type": "text", "x": 410, "y": 213.875, "width": 130, "height": 13.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "coordinadora, Lima", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 11, "containerId": null, "originalText": "coordinadora, Lima", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1}, {"id": "r9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 620, "y": 163, "width": 250, "height": 94, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated":